{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53929","headline":"游香山寺 · 韩琮","name":"游香山寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"信马盘桓上碧穹，云埋松翠梵王宫。\n老僧细说禅机话，深会菩提色即空。\n（同前）（按：诗下原署：「宋韩琮，员外郎。\n」检宋人传记专书，未闻有韩琮其人。\n唐之韩琮，尝官司封员外郎，任陈许节度判官，官职既合，汝州亦其曾到之地，作宋人误。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩琮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53929.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53929","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}